### Health Check
GET http://localhost:30080/health
Accept: application/json

###

### CPU-bound Work (POST) - Low Complexity
POST http://localhost:30080/work
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "delay_ms": 50,
  "complexity": "low"
}

###

### CPU-bound Work (POST) - High Complexity
POST http://localhost:30080/work
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "delay_ms": 200,
  "complexity": "high"
}

###

### CPU-bound Work (GET) - Medium Complexity
GET http://localhost:30080/work?delay_ms=100&complexity=medium
Accept: application/json

###

### Stress Test - Medium Intensity (10 seconds)
GET http://localhost:30080/stress?duration_seconds=10&intensity=medium
Accept: application/json

###

### Stress Test - High Intensity (5 seconds)
GET http://localhost:30080/stress?duration_seconds=5&intensity=high
Accept: application/json
